// Red Faction for N-Gage (.xff) objects -> Red Faction classes, for converting N-Gage levels.
//
// One row per scene file a level places (a 1006 prefab), by its file name (case does not matter):
//   "kind":   "entity" (entity.tbl), "item" (items.tbl), "clutter" (clutter.tbl) or "playerStart";
//   "class":  the exact Red Faction class name (not used for "playerStart");
//   "marker": entities only: the enemy type the scene's own marker gives (32xx). A level's 42xx spawn point
//             spawns the entity whose marker is the spawn's type minus 1000;
//   "count":  items only: what the item gives (items.tbl's $Count).
// Rows under "leftOut" are scenes with no Red Faction counterpart: they are not converted and the report lists them.
// To change a mapping, change its "class" (for example the barrel's "Oil Drum" to "Ultor Barrel Yellow").
